@subsection build_method Build Instructions
To build the package please refer to *@ref README.md "BUILD"**

@subsection launch_method Launch Files - Node Startup and Execution (Usage)
```all.launch.py``` - This launch file will start all 3 nodes together, and is the recommended way to start the system. It will also start all dependencies, like the UR_driver, MoveIt Servo, and Realsense Camera program.
```controller_test.launch.py``` - Starts the Controller node on its own, without any dependencies. 
```ui_test.launch.py``` - Starts the UI node on its own, without any dependencies.

Refer to the source code for detailed topic and service names, and to adjust parameters as needed for your environment.

